      { q: "The custom 404 page's ONE non-negotiable job is…", a: ["Show the brand logo", "Give the user a clear way back (egress)", "Play an animation", "Log the broken link"], c: 1, w: "A 404 that makes the user work is a failure — the joke and the art are garnish on top of 'get me out of here'." }
